// 'domainService), that resolves names over the NIE's DNS service: a query (address from
// name, name from address, mail address, mail server) is queued, answered from the
// "Internet DNS Cache" soup when it can be, else sent to the TCP/IP stack as an endpoint
// option, and the answer cached. The install script waits for the unit it imports
// (|Inet Protos:NIE|) before it installs. The file holds the part and what only it reaches.

